/channels

📡  Channels

  • server:discord — active
    • discord (from config.toml (user); overrides definition from config.toml (project))
      • declares codex/channel
  • server:missing — matched no configured MCP server
  • server:blocked — blocked (not in [channels] allowed)
  • nonsense — invalid (channel entry `nonsense` is missing a `server:` or `plugin:` prefix)
